                "Developed an AI-driven telemedicine platform that predicts diseases, recommends doctors, and simplifies healthcare access through smart automation and real-time data management.",
                "Implemented Machine Learning algorithms based on disease prediction and specialist recommendation.",
                "Integrated Flask, Firebase Firestore, and Selenium for secure real-time operations and doctor verification with a responsive HTML, CSS, and JavaScript frontend.",
                "Enabled automatic severity scoring and nearest doctor search, enhancing user experience and emergency accessibility."
            ],
            domains: ["Python", "Flask", "Machine Learning", "Firebase", "Selenium"]
        },
        {
            name: "Sharman Foundation - Full Stack Intern",
